 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note first recorded that the ledger depends on auth-gateway, and when?\n[2025-03-17] standup/atlas/2025-03-17: If the auth gateway is down, the ledger service is down: it relies on it for service tokens. [2025-04-08] standup/dune/2025-04-08: Reminder that the reporting service depends on the ledger. [2025-09-15] standup/dune/2025-09-15: We decided that reporting will read from the event-bus instead of querying the ledger directly. The reason: the nightly ledger scans were blocking billing runs. That removes the dependency on Ledger from reporting.",
